{{ sdk.name }} has different support levels, based on its license tiers and your needs.

## GitHub Issues

All license customers can use [GitHub Issues]({{sdk.url_gumroad}}) to get report problems, request features, discuss etc. This is also where the product roadmap is managed and future versions are planned.

## E-mail Support

Silver tier customers can reach out over e-mail to discuss problems and implementation details, schedule paid support, etc.

## Prioritized Support

Gold tier customers get prioritized support, which means their needs will be considered and prioritized when planning bug fixes and future releases.

## Dedicated Support

Business license customers can customize the support level to fit their needs, include a custom set of included support tickets, schedule recurring support activites, pay for recurring support, etc.


## Communication

The various tiers include access to various communication channels.


### Onboarding Call

Gold tier customers have the option to connect over an initial onboarding call, where we’ll discuss your needs and help you get started.

### Monthly Call

Business customers have the option to opt-in to a monthly call, where we can keep track of your project, discuss any problems or questions that you may have, etc.

### Discord Server

The SDK Discord server is available to all license customers. Gold tier customers will get a private, company-specific channel for internal discussions.